# Custom infill 2D tile: rectilinear-equivalent.
# A single horizontal line spanning the tile width. Tiled across columns the
# lines join end-to-end; serpentine reverses alternate rows so the toolpath
# chains continuously. Row pitch = tile height (2 mm here).
#
# Format:
#   TILE <width_mm> <height_mm>
#   MODE serpentine
#   PATH x1,y1 x2,y2 ...        (mm, tile-local; multiple PATH lines allowed)
TILE 10 2
MODE serpentine
PATH 0,1 10,1
